 "src/renderer/src/extensions/settings_application/texts.ts": {
  "By default, every user account on your system has its own \"instance\" of Vortex with their own settings, mods, profiles and so on.\n\nIf you want to share these things between all users of your PC, you can toggle to \"Shared\" mode. In this mode all data will be stored in a global location and available to all users on this system.\n\nPlease note that this includes login credentials for Nexus Mods and other, potentially confidential, pieces of information you enter in Vortex.\n\nThis switch is not destructive. The data stored with your user account is not touched while you're in shared mode, so you can toggle back and forth.": {
   "liczba": false
  }
 },
