 "src/renderer/src/extensions/settings_interface/texts.ts": {
  "Categories are maintained as a tree, so for example the Category \"Audio\" could have child categories \"Effects\" and \"Music\". If you're using the Categories from Nexus, you will find that all categories have a rather useless \"root\" that corresponds to the game name, so the whole path would be \"Skyrim -> Audio -> Effects\".\nThis option will shorten the displayed category by hiding that root.": {
   "liczba": false
  },
